     * Compare {@code fromVersion} and {@code toVersion}.
     *
     * <p>The method is tolerant to malformed input: {@code null}, empty strings,
     * missing components or non‑numeric components are treated as {@code 0}.
     * This prevents {@link ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException} and
     * {@link NumberFormatException} from bubbling up and potentially causing a
     * denial‑of‑service.</p>
